From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UniFrog Maintainers <unifrog@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 05:29:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Port and harden upstream MAME 2000 for UniFrog SF2000

Add the MIPS32r1 soft-float static port and device controls, then fix upstream out-of-bounds array loops, invalid discrete saturation, stale i86 flag reads, unbounded NES APU counts, and content-directory lifetime. The fixes keep the module safe under GCC 15 optimization without changing its supported driver set.
---
